WEBVTT

13:30.509 --> 13:32.719
Let's go to my room, guys!

13:32.803 --> 13:35.638
Red alert! Red alert!
Andy is coming upstairs!

13:36.348 --> 13:37.682
-There!
-Juvenile intrusion!

13:37.767 --> 13:39.559
Repeat, resume
your positions now!

13:39.643 --> 13:42.312
Andy's coming! Everybody,
back to your places! Hurry!

13:42.396 --> 13:44.397
Get to your places!
Get to your places!

13:44.482 --> 13:46.816
Where's my ear? Who's seen my ear?
Did you see my ear?

13:46.901 --> 13:49.944
Out of my way! Here I come!
Here I come!
